            "displayAsButton": false,
            "buttonSize": "big",
            "goToSlideType": "specified",
            "invisible": false,
            "solution": ""
          },
          {
            "x": 2.23463687150838,
            "y": 13.245033112582783,
            "width": 92.73743016759778,
            "height": 86.09271523178808,
            "action": {
              "library": "H5P.AdvancedText 1.1",
              "params": {
                "text": "<p><strong>Early Life of Benjamin Franklin</strong><br>\nBenjamin Franklin was born on January 17, 1706, in Boston, Massachusetts. He was the fifteenth child of his father, Josiah Franklin, who was a soap and candle maker. Benjamin left school at the age of ten and started working with his father. At twelve, he became an apprentice to his brother James, a printer, where he learned the printing trade. This experience sparked his lifelong love for books and reading.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Benjamin Franklin's Career in Printing</strong><br>\nFranklin moved to Philadelphia at the age of 17, seeking new opportunities. He worked in several printing shops in town. After improving his skills, Franklin opened his own printing business, which published the \"Pennsylvania Gazette.\" He also started \"Poor Richard's Almanack\" in 1732, which became famous for its proverbs and sayings. His printing business was so successful that he was able to retire by the age of 42.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Inventions and Scientific Discoveries</strong><br>\nFranklin had a keen interest in science and was a prolific inventor. His curiosity led to the invention of the lightning rod, which protected buildings from fires caused by lightning. He also invented bifocal glasses, the Franklin stove, and a musical instrument called the glass armonica. He conducted experiments with electricity and mapped the Gulf Stream, a major Atlantic Ocean current.</p>\n"
              },
              "metadata": {
                "contentType": "Text",
                "license": "U",
                "title": "Unbenannt: Text",
                "defaultLanguage": "en"
              },
              "subContentId": "53bc5361-5ce5-43a9-a00f-57bbceee9cd0"
            },
            "alwaysDisplayComments": false,
            "backgroundOpacity": 0,
            "displayAsButton": false,
            "buttonSize": "big",
